#, machine, plain1, python-format
msgid "Hate speech is protected by the First Amendment. You may find it obnoxious and vile, but someone somewhere probably finds something about you obnoxious too. Rest assured that *your* controversial views will not result in a ban from %(site)s."
msgstr "Vihakõnet kaitseb esimene parandus. Sa võid leida, et see on ebameeldiv ja alatu, kuid keegi kuskil ilmselt leiab midagi sinust ebameeldiv ka. Võite olla kindlad, et * teie * vastuolulised vaated ei too kaasa %(site)s keeldu."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "Have Rep in the guild you are attempting to siege (exact requirement depends on guild size and age)"
msgstr "Kas teil on maine gildis, mida proovite üle võtta (täpne nõue sõltub gildi suurusest ja vanusest)"

#, machine, plain1
msgid "Have a post forwarded to the guild being sieged"
msgstr "Postitage gildile, keda piiratakse"

